      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-03-04_WidnesExaminer_art0006" n="art0006">
        <head>Wanted.</head>
        <p>Wanted.</p>
        <p>IF you want your Property Managed, Rents 1 Collected, or Properties •Sold, apply Percy J. Cox. &amp;aut. Agent- and Surveyor, 193, High-street, East Ham. Tel. East Haan 262.</p>
        <p>Medical.</p>
        <p>Financial Accommodation. Prospective Borrowers are invited to ascertain Our Terms and Conditions before applying elsewhere. No Charge made unless business aetually completed. Advances of £2O to £5.000 upon Simple Promissory Note or Furniture without removal, Special rates on Life Policies.</p>
        <p>Repayments: 1 to 3 years, at reasonable interest. NO ELUSIVE TERMS ADVERTISED, each appli- cation treated upon its merits with Promptness and Courtesy. Call or write in Strictest Confidence to-- F. LAWRENCE, Ltd., 7, Park Square, Leeds</p>
