        <p>rrittrs to or (Ebitor</p>
        <p>• ht s fICE A. SLACKERS.</p>
        <p>think all the starred single men ought to be made to fight for their country. A good many young men--cowards I call them—are tied to , their sweethearts' apron strings. No young single man, is indispensable-. his job could be given to a married man or a woman. A lot of these starred single men are nothing but cowards, just making money for themselves and their firm. Lloyd George ought to get after all the starred single . men in justice to • the ,„ men in the trenches. Many young women are to blame, holding these Men back.</p>
