        <p>Embroidery: 1, Private Wilson; 2, Private Pocock; Frangleton. , Special Prize for Embroidered Badge's: Private McLeod; honourable mention, Corporal Brown. . _</p>
        <p>Fret- Carving: Hand-carved. l'rivate Hunt. Machine-carved, Private King. Beginn&amp;s, Private Briggs.</p>
        <p>Fancy Articles: 1, Private Widdolves; 2, Private Prinee;. Private Clippingaale; 4, Rifleman Oakes; 5, Private, Naylor; 6, Privates Mitchell and,Titheridge. Wool Mats: 1, Sergeant Bennett.</p>
        <p>Silk Mats: 1. Private Goddard; 2, Private Williams; 3, Private Frangleton ; 4, Private Wilson. . .</p>
