      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-03-04_WidnesExaminer_art0181" n="art0181">
        <head>What Every Mother Should Know.</head>
        <p>What Every Mother Should Know.</p>
        <p>Doctors declare that cough-cures containing opium, morphine, or paregoric should never be given to children, save under medical directions., Most -cough mixtures contain those things;. Veno's Lightning Cough Cure does not. Veno's is guaranteed poison-free,- and • the ideal - 'children's cough remedy. All kinds of children's coughs yield to Veno's— even whooping cough, however Violent. Awarded Grand Prix and Gold Medal, International Health Exhibition, Paris, 1910. Mrs. Percivall, 44, London Road, Grays, Essex, says: "I am quite satisfied that Veno's Lightning Cough Cure sayed my baby's life. She had been suffering for tweeks with whooping cough and bronchitis, and. was just as ill as she could be. At last I tried Veno's and it was simply marvellous how quickly she got well." Veno's Lit/liming Cough Cure is the safest and surest remedy for— - Coughs and Colds, Bronchitis, ide Nasal Asthma,ma, Catarrh, Lung Troubles Ja 2 Children's Coughs, Influenza, Old-Age Coughs, Difficult Brcathivig Bat±343. Blood-Spitting. Larger Sires 1/3 and 3/-. The 3/- size is the most economical. Of aa Chemists and Stores in all parts of the World. •</p>
      </div>
