        <p>TERRITORIAL ROLL OF HONOUR. KILLED. 'Missing Man Now Reported killed In Action. PRIVATE J. D. RENSHAW. Buried By :41e1l Explosion In A • Dull-Out. Official information • was received this week by Mr. and Mrs. David Renshaw, 68, Longford- street, to the effect that their son, Private...Tolin David Renshaw, Of the Warrington Terri- torials, who was reported missing _after the .BritiSh *advance 'last September, was killed in action. • 'Private Renshaw Was in the machine gu,n section and at the time Sergeant Widocks sent word that he 'feared Jack was buried by. a shell explosion in a dug-out. Private Renshaw' was formerly in the employ of Messrs. H.</p>
